  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine the total number of envelopes Wyatt has, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Identify the number of blue envelopes Wyatt has.\n2. Calculate the number of yellow envelopes Wyatt has.\n3. Add the number of blue envelopes and yellow envelopes together to find the total number of envelopes.\n\nStep 1: Identify the number of blue envelopes.\nWyatt has 10 blue envelopes.\n\nStep 2: Calculate the number of yellow envelopes.\nWyatt has 4 fewer yellow envelopes than blue envelopes. Therefore, the number of yellow envelopes is:\n\\[ 10 - 4 = 6 \\]\n\nStep 3: Add the number of blue envelopes and yellow envelopes together.\nThe total number of envelopes is the sum of the blue envelopes and the yellow envelopes:\n\\[ 10 + 6 = 16 \\]\n\nThus, the total number of envelopes Wyatt has is \\(\\boxed{16}\\).",
